msgid "TEMPO_HELP"
msgstr "Tempo is how fast the music moves. The BPM number counts quarter notes per minute. Enter a base BPM to make it the new 100%. The speed slider scales from that base without changing pitches. Later tempo changes keep their proportions. A new song uses its own BPM."

